    "description": "Join the Bajaj Allianz Life South Asia Partners family as a Financial Analyst in Ludhiana. We believe in empowering our employees with the tools, training, and environment they need to succeed.\n\nAbout Bajaj Allianz Life South Asia Partners:\nBajaj Allianz Life South Asia Partners is a leading organization in the Hybrid sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Monitor financial performance against targets and provide variance analysis\n• Prepare and analyze financial statements, reports, and budgets\n• Prepare MIS reports for senior management review\n• Develop financial models and projections for business planning\n• Process payroll and manage employee reimbursements\n• Manage credit risk assessment and loan appraisal processes\n• Coordinate with external auditors during annual audits\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• B.Tech / B.E. in Computer Science or related discipline\n• 0-1 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in Ind AS\n• Proficiency in Bloomberg Terminal\n• Proficiency in Credit Analysis\n• Proficiency in Financial Reporting\n• Proficiency in Power BI\n• Proficiency in Income Tax\n• Proficiency in QuickBooks\n• Proficiency in Due Diligence\n\nWork Mode: Hybrid - Flexible work-from-home and office\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Learning & development budget\n• Competitive salary with performance-linked incentives\n• Life and accident insurance\n• Professional development and training programs\n• Transportation and conveyance allowance\n• Company-sponsored certifications\n• Salary Range: 2.5 LPA - 6 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Ludhiana, Punjab, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with Bajaj Allianz Life South Asia Partners!",
